   "cooked": "<p>This period covers praise given between <strong>25 October 2022 and 06 November 2022</strong>. We allocated a maximum of <strong>1874.0</strong> TEC tokens for rewards, with the ceiling achieved at <strong>158</strong>. Some praise accounts still haven’t been activated so the total amount below will be less than what we set aside to distribute.</p>\n<p>Out of the total rewards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90% of the tokens were given as praise rewards <img alt=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/pray.png?v=10\" title=\":pray:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>7% distributed among quantifiers <img alt=\":balance_scale:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/balance_scale.png?v=10\" title=\":balance_scale:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>3% assigned to the reward board <img alt=\":memo:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/memo.png?v=10\" title=\":memo:\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This data has been reviewed by the Quantifiers and the Reward Board, and has been submitted for distribution to the <a href=\"https://xdai.aragon.blossom.software/#/rewardboardtec/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Reward Board DAO</a></p>\n<p>You can check out the <a href=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/CommonsBuild/tec-rewards/c501ba7d9bce43c738b51c0d7f65d6d0913d793b/distribution_rounds/round-21/distribution_results/reports/round-21--cross-period-analysis-report.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">full period analysis here</a>. <img alt=\":bar_chart:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/bar_chart.png?v=10\" title=\":bar_chart:\"/></p>\n<p>This post will be open to the community for review for 48 hours then submitted to the Reward Board for final execution. <img alt=\":heavy_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/heavy_check_mark.png?v=10\" title=\":heavy_check_mark:\"/></p>\n<p>The Rewards Distribution for this round is as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Username</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">Rewards in TEC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">r-x-x#8344</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">116.828</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">akrtws (TE Academy)<span class=\"hashtag\">#4246</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">104.277</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">bear100#9085</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">74.2156</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">pat.zip (TE Academy)<span class=\"hashtag\">#5266</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">56.4566</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">enti#1546</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">52.2983</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">divine_comedian#5493</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">46.3991</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Zeptimus#3359</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">43.8218</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Nuggan#5183</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">41.1662</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">kristofer#1475</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">38.4106</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">GideonRo#3175</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">37.5844</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">natesuits#4789</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">35.0255</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Tamarandom#9361</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">31.8268</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Maxwe11#7157</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">28.6281</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">BiancaGadelha#2667</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">18.7122</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">miguelb#5176</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">18.0725</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">chuygarcia.eth#6692</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">16.793</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Juankbell#7458</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">15.5136</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">tigeroid#2951</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">15.2671</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">liviade#1387</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">15.0338</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Mettodo#7010</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">14.622</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">r33pich33p#6906</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">8.31655</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">durgadas#9280</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">4.31821</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">streamerd#5565</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.51854</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">withinthevacuum#2626</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.51854</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Jeanne#8780</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.51854</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">stratatrader#8522</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.10271</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">innov8tor3#3988</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1.61213</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">brolag#0110</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1.59934</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">angieberry.eth#9822</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">1.59934</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Atotsm#5719</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0.959602</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Araujo#0999</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">0.959602</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>",
